  "commit_message": "fix(docs): render `+optional` kubebuilder markers correctly\n\nBefore, these `+kubebuilder:validation:Optional` were rendered expecting\na value for the marker, but since they carry no value, their Go struct\nserialises to an empty {}.\n\nNow, strip these empty {} suffix in the templates before the renderer\nescapes it until this is solved upstream:\nhttps://github.com/elastic/crd-ref-docs/issues/198\n\nSigned-off-by: Víctor Cuadrado Juan <vcuadradojuan@suse.de>",
